# Rendered by dev_lab.dev.famconfig from the family base for .gitattributes.
# Hand edits RED. The base is data in dev_lab.dev._famconfig_rows;
# this repo's own lines are its declared delta. Change one, re-render, commit.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.jpg binary
*.npz binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.sh text eol=lf
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary

# --- overrides delta, 1 of 1 allowed ---
*.h5 binary
